{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09129","headline":"上东门会送李幼举南游徐方 · 韦应物","name":"上东门会送李幼举南游徐方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离弦既罢弹，罇酒亦已阑。\n听我歌一曲，南徐在云端。\n云端虽云邈，行路本非难。\n诸侯皆爱才，公子远结欢。\n济济都门宴，将去复盘桓。\n令姿何昂昂，良马远游冠。\n意气且爲别，由来非所叹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}